rem Coloured Configurations
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=194
rem Count the proper colourings with
rem Colours colours of a chain of Na
rem type A and Nb type B units, modulo
rem Modulo

use numbers
use io
use cli

option Na integer = 25
option Nb integer = 75
option Colours integer = 1984
option Modulo integer = 100000000

rem A unit is coloured in A(c) or B(c)
rem ways once its first vertices are
rem set; c (c - 1) colour the first
rem edge, and the units may come in any
rem of C(Na + Nb, Na) orders.
C = Colours
A = C ** 5 - 9 * C ** 4 + 34 * C ** 3
A = A - 69 * C ** 2 + 77 * C - 38
B = (C - 2) ** 3 * (C ** 2 - 2 * C + 3)
Orders = (Na + Nb) binomial Na
Ways = Orders * C * (C - 1) mod Modulo
Pa = A Na Modulo powmod
Pb = B Nb Modulo powmod
Mix = Ways * Pa mod Modulo
Answer = Mix * Pb mod Modulo
Answer print
